# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile

@BrauereiApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7297

POST {{BrauereiApi_HostAddress}}/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Märzen",
  "lagerbestand": 1000,
  "mindestbestand": 200,
  "flaschengroesse": 0.5
}


### Märzen aktualisieren
PUT https://localhost:7297/api/inventory/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Märzen",
  "lagerbestand": 800,
  "mindestbestand": 200,
  "flaschengroesse": 0.5
}


### Märzen löschen
DELETE https://localhost:7297/api/inventory/1
